tllama-server (0.6.0~dev+b11552.2-3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Build every backend by default with plain debuild, including the complete
    SDK dependency set and ROCm header conflict check.
  * Keep individual and combined profiles for restricted package builds, and
    retain the explicit all profile as an alias for the default.

