tllama-server (0.6.0~dev+b11552.2-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Support combined component profiles and an all-backends build profile.
  * Keep compiler environments and native build trees separate while producing
    one package set and changes file from a single debhelper sequence.
  * Preserve per-CUDA driver dependencies and private runtime library metadata.

